  "finalReply": "Implemented `parse_tx.js` in `/app/parse_tx.js`:\n\n- Reads hex file from `process.argv[2]`, strips all whitespace, validates hex.\n- Parses version, VarInt input/output counts (1/3/5/9-byte forms), inputs (`txid` byte-reversed lowercase hex, `vout`, `scriptsig` hex, `sequence`), outputs (`value` via `readBigUInt64LE` → `Number`, `scriptpubkey` hex), and locktime — all little-endian.\n- Outputs only required JSON fields (`version`, `input_count`, `inputs`, `output_count`, `outputs`, `locktime`) to stdout.\n- Malformed/incomplete data, trailing bytes, missing file/arg → error to stderr with non-zero exit.\n- Uses only `fs` + `Buffer`.\n\nUsage: `node parse_tx.js /app/tx.hex > output.json`",
